qFX0S9-ceUEQ7kNvwHMotBF&_nc_oc=AdpjVsVpdl-UO5SoYPpl26yrw_nP-17DReGQAXvM1UGZhL3eEALDbEjPyzo_CWZ0jdE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-d-3FrDy1kWMnvbfROW9686EIJj82_duBPOUYoRveZiA&oe=6A2D65B7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yZ-kq3OGpWgQ7kNvwF2pKwC&_nc_oc=AdpfoFEyo0gmy0vPPE4eKVtlBAApyCaY6VW14Bpiso0M4pVChW6xzl16MFqU_o-J0Zg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-P_JnO2G4nTbaIhM4I-sUZ7URAmR-Y7Lhj07RxF7jN0w&oe=6A2D674A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dctpVg49tCMQ7kNvwHUqR5a&_nc_oc=AdoYUbEfG8c4_vgsPvSeJNQV4VdZMqU9gHVB0kGcGbYdIZVTnBBJUI8TrQpZTrskh_U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9fHyS4KKgdtR36E5H-_iC5ZPynYY67ArpXYkuL2kle7w&oe=6A2D546F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jdkUuoW7tYEQ7kNvwFm92md&_nc_oc=AdoUNr3LgcsQ9QDhCLgcsnXr5NfZzncL2LjTUl0rOY_YuCOZBLTm0uquASo1ugQd_AA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_ezx9-RNe2rn5Ir4_Fz3K34EocflfdmpMOWnBgTI7Sew&oe=6A2D7603"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WRVXuSUsLBMQ7kNvwGt5DyY&_nc_oc=AdpvH5k-Hy5IdkLMmC_wbj2FSdDKucavwgkJ6G5OgjFgtFpsh0yZxbV4OQFUmrjKU4Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af90B_wZ0jmC6DUJ07QWQFQXjcFC5ozO86t7Ndid1RSNeA&oe=6A2D6E58"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RKro24uJ0ogQ7kNvwEOC3hz&_nc_oc=AdoANIrmXYMBvNvS1IK7NqwnoYsz0xVEd208PIUS4GlK-CsbDjoTV59Et4m5qrvih0s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8r7zoHcHQeKXzCSR_CIoqIl0sBsPtbSrsA4p5aE_WVWw&oe=6A2D493C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080